config SENSOR_WASM_BRIDGE
	bool "Let the host set what the emulated sensors measure"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_WASM_HOST_SENSOR_BRIDGE_ENABLED
	depends on SENSOR && EMUL
	help
	  Readings the host queues -- a page tilting the board, a scripted
	  run -- handed to the board's emulated sensors through the
	  emulated-sensor backend API, from an interrupt. The sensor drivers
	  then read them over the emulated bus as they would read a chip.
